Not many.

They are formidable opponents, but as a pet, they're not as useful as
many other pets.

Main reason being that they cannot use their spellcasting attacks when
they're your pet.

Good things about them are that they can wield weapons, and teleport to
you, reducing the need for a magic whistle.

A disadvantage is that they will often impede your movement, suddenly
appearing in front of you every once in a while.

And they will kill themselves, quite often, if confronted with a blue
